					"nextDialogs": [
						401430506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430506,
					"content": "不過第一口還是由客人先用吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430507,
					"content": "對、對哦，畢竟這次你們才是客人…嗯？你們怎麼都不吃啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430508,
					"content": "（醬汁…看起來有點重…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430509,
					"content": "（按照璃月的餐桌禮儀…我是不是該先禮讓一下…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430510,
					"content": "#咳…那麼，就讓我先來嚐嚐{NICKNAME}的手藝吧！嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430511,
					"content": "怎麼樣？要喝點水嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430512,
					"content": "不用…很鮮，非常純粹的味道。明明裹了一層醬汁，卻只有海洋本身的鮮味…你們也嚐嚐看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430513,
					"content": "好、好的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430514,
					"content": "這味道…難道是蟹黃？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430515,
					"content": "答對囉！不愧是琳妮特！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
