					"nextDialogs": [
						401430520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430520,
					"content": "奇怪…派蒙什麼時候這麼有學問了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430521,
						401430522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430521,
					"content": "食譜背得還滿熟的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430523
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401430523,
					"content": "這道菜應該滿對妳胃口吧？琳妮特…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430524,
					"content": "啊！「金玉滿堂」只剩一半了？什麼時候被吃的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401430525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401430525,
					"content": "就在妳滔滔不絕的時候…",
